   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 840414,
   "text": "Address = hash(seeds + bump\n               + program_id)\n\n\u2022 seeds hold the user's pubkey,\n  so each wallet gets its own\n  vault \u2014 no user id is stored\n\n\u2022 no private key exists, so only\n  this program can sign as vault\n\n\u2022 bump saved once; address is\n  re-derived, never stored",
